{"task_id": 2, "prompt": "Write a function to find the shared elements from the given two lists.", "samples": ["def test_similar_elements():\n    assert similar_elements([1, 2, 3], [3, 4, 5]) == [3]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements([1, 2, 3], [3, 4, 5]) == [3]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements((1, 2, 3, 4), (3, 4, 5, 6)) == [3, 4]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements ([1, 2, 3, 4], [3, 4, 5, 6]) == [3, 4]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements([1, 2, 3], [3, 4, 5]) == [3]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements([1, 2, 3], [3, 4, 5]) == [3]\nsimilar_elements()", "def test_similar_elements():\n\tassert similar_elements([1, 2, 3, 4], [4, 5, 6, 1]) == {1, 4}\nsimilar_elements()"]}
