{"task_id": 4, "prompt": "Write a function to find the n largest integers from a given list of numbers, returned in descending order.", "samples": ["def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([5, 1, 3, 6, 2, 4], 3) == [6, 5, 4]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n    assert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 5, 7, 2, 4], 3) == [7, 5, 4]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 5, 7, 9, 2], 3) == [9, 7, 5]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 5, 7, 9, 2, 6], 3) == [9, 7, 6]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n    assert heap_queue_largest([4, 1, 7, 3, 9, 2], 3) == [9, 7, 4]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6, 5], 4) == [9, 6, 5, 5]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 5, 12, 7, 9, 2], 4) == [12, 9, 7, 5]\nheap_queue_largest()", "def test_heap_queue_largest():\n\tassert heap_queue_largest([3, 1, 5, 7, 2, 4], 3) == [7, 5, 4]\nheap_queue_largest()"]}
