{"task_id": 12, "prompt": "Write a function to sort a given matrix in ascending order according to the sum of its rows.", "samples": ["def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [4, 0], [5]]) == [[0, 4], [1, 2, 3], [5]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [9, 0], [4, 5]]) == [[1, 2, 3], [0, 9], [4, 5]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [9, 8], [4, 5, 6]]) == [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [8, 9]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [9, 8], [4, 5, 6]]) == [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [8, 9]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [4, 0], [5]]) == [[0], [1, 2, 3], [4], [5]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\t\tassert sort_matrix([[3, 1, 2], [6, 4], [5, 0]]) == [[3, 1, 2], [5, 0], [6, 4]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix ([[3, 1, 2], [9, 0], [4]]) == [[1, 2, 3], [0, 9], [4]]\nsort_matrix()", "def test_sort_matrix():\n\tassert sort_matrix ([[3, 1, 2], [9, 8], [4, 5, 6]]) == [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [8, 9]]\nsort_matrix()"]}
